@startuml GameStateManager
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title GameStateManager
rectangle c [
|= Responsibilities |= Collaborators |
| Hold current game state | GameState |
| Validate each transition | GameStateGraph |
| Create and switch screens | Main, menu pages |
| Generate map off the main thread | MapGenerator |
| Keep the paused game | GameScreen |
| Trigger the tower defence event once per game | TileMapRenderer, GameStateGraph |
]
@enduml
